<title>SPAIN: Spain's Treasury account with BoS fell in Jan, Feb.</title>
<headline>Spain's Treasury account with BoS fell in Jan, Feb.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury reduced its current account balance with the Bank of Spain in the first two months of 1997 by 557 billion pesetas, Budget Secretary Jose Folgado said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The current account stood at 1.97 trillion pesetas at the end of February from 2.53 at December 1996&quot;, Folgado said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
